adapter/adapter_model.safetensors is a derivative work of one tensor of Gemma 4 (a model family from Google DeepMind):
  source tensor : model.language_model.per_layer_model_projection (weight_packed / weight_scale) of
                  google/gemma-4-E4B-it-qat-w4a16-ct, revision 6cd26aaa2357fb2bad8c51699a7558a4d1a965bb
  licence       : Apache License 2.0, according to that model card (license_link https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license)
  changes       : the int4 tensor was dequantised and replaced by its best rank-128 approximation (truncated singular value decomposition, bfloat16 factors),
                  which, added to the base weight, approximates multiplying the tensor by 2. No training data and no gradient updates were used.
                  See adapter/build_adapter.py and adapter/lowrank.py.
adapter/adapter_config.json is a PEFT-format configuration written by adapter/build_adapter.py.
The original Gemma 4 checkpoints, and GGUF files derived from them, are not part of this repository.
